{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_018_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "a9a7ac86b25571ddeaccb665c3ff181d03ea6969637201f326bcd13dbf473eab", "ja": "ええっ、忘れちゃったの、{$P$}！\n公演が始まる前に、私、言ったでしょっ？", "zh": "咦咦！你忘了吗，{$P$}！\n我在公演开始前不是有说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
