{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_018_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b9fb5d46a32ae0a2c044efd20a3573cbfa6e5ac547fc5807254a414e2f12cf1f", "ja": "ああ、そのことか！\nそうだったな。約束、守ってくれてありがとう！", "zh": "啊，是这件事啊！\n我想起来了，谢谢你完成了约定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_018_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "2418b4fae7842948845f24fbc52884ebe35c5752082cded8d9eec8d952c0b3da", "ja": "えへへ～、どういたしまして！", "zh": "嘿嘿～不用客气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
