{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_018_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "99db288a56da709a67d2a50fade5a730e4c67493f4fac0de76d2fee91f90b40e", "ja": "だから、ちゃんと頑張ったつもり。いっつも\n勢いだけーとか、元気だけーとかじゃないからねっ？", "zh": "所以我有好好努力。我可不是永远\n都只会靠气势和活力横冲直撞的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_018_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8a45494134b7dc8e3ec0f95701b3e218da3e97fb627c0118b6699d1e4b461bbe", "ja": "もちろん。海美がとっても可愛い女の子だって\nことも、知ってるつもりだよ。", "zh": "这我当然知道。\n我还知道海美是个非常可爱的女孩子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_018_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "72f6b53db9333110baaaafc61afeaf0910e44bbdbad03000ff6ccafd0b0e9ebf", "ja": "か、可愛い……えへ……えへへ～～～！\nありがとっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "可、可爱……嘿嘿……嘿嘿～～～！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_018_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "8fd3067e454512e08ef26eeac96e45a5e5633b02f651a567dc395446886cf6ac", "ja": "はあ～。でも、公演ホント楽しかったな～！\n次の公演はいつ？　いつやるの？", "zh": "哇～不过，公演真的好欢乐喔～！\n下次公演是什么时候？什么时候要办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
